# Host-driven profile: the image runs under the vmd host tool, which
# serves the hmd and wand itself over the hsvc channel - drv_hsvc dials
# the host (VMD_PROTO_HOST, or VMD_ADDR to override) and nothing local
# needs to run. With no host answering, the runtime's own simulated
# device keeps a head up.
HSVC_SVC_NAMES=""

# Stage the OpenXR runtime (monado + drv_hsvc) and enable the shell:
# monado.service + hibiscus-shell.service go live when mkimage has the
# xr artifacts (xr/build-runtime.sh out dir plus a dash-wayland build).
HSVC_XR=1
